# Bouncing Squares with Shrinking Walls — Revideo Scene Reproduction

> The agent must reverse-engineer a reference animation (`reference.mp4`) showing 12 colored squares bouncing inside a bounded area with shrinking/recovering walls, and reproduce it as a Revideo scene in TypeScript (`src/project.tsx`). The core challenge is deducing the physics simulation (collision detection, wall dynamics, 3-phase wall animation) from visual inspection alone, using an unfamiliar animation framework.

---

## Task Configuration

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Difficulty | Hard |
| Category | Animation |
| Agent Timeout | 2 hours (7200s) |
| Verifier Timeout | 20 minutes (1200s) |
| Internet Access | Enabled (waivered — see Notes) |
| CPUs / Memory | 8 CPUs / 32 GB |

